@startuml SSD US 2.2.12 - Manage Physical Resource (Create / Activate / Deactivate)
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor Black
  ActorBorderColor #000000
  ActorBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    LifeLineBorderColor Black
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    ParticipantBorderColor Black
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    ParticipantFontStyle bold
}

actor "Logistics Operator" as Officer
participant "«system (C4)»\nPort Operations System" as System

activate Officer
Officer -> System : 1: choose operation (create | update | deactivate)
activate System
System  --> Officer : 1.1: request necessary data
deactivate System

Officer -> System : 2: provide requested data / action
activate System
System  --> Officer : 2.1: action completed successfully 
deactivate System
deactivate Officer

@enduml
